"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4603740","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1846018067937460","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO V2.0X is here… and the crew just got cuddlier! 🚀","summary":"The final version of the ASANA demo has arrived, and look who showed up to celebrate: our full set of ASANA character plushies! 🐾Softer crew. Same cosmic chaos. And yes, N.E.K.O. is still judging you.We can’t wait for you to jump into DEMO V2.0X and experience the beginning of Asana’s epic sci-fi adventure. Give it a try, meet your questionable new companions, and let us know what you think!One very important question before takeoff: which plushie is your favorite?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T23:07:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937460","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1844115010499797","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"GiveAway - Tabletop Gaming Guild","summary":"Hey everyone! A big thank you to Tabletop Gaming Guild for supporting ASANA and hosting a giveaway! 🐱🚀 ASANA is a solo passion project, so seeing someone take the time to share it with their community means a lot to me. Getting a small indie game noticed isn’t easy, and support like this helps my strange little universe find its way to new players. Check out their video for the giveaway details and how to participate. While you’re there, please show them some love! Have a look around their chann","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T20:30:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499797","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1843481262698438","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"Cat-Astophic... doll READY!","summary":"Here we have another doll, this time it's Cat-Astrophic, only one missing lil sis Paradox!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T22:15:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1843481262697001","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 2.0: a rebuilt interface, and 11 languages in human hands","summary":"Demo 2.0 arrives on 7 October, and it is the largest update the demo has had since it first went up. Two things changed: the interface was rebuilt, and the last of the localization work landed. The interface This started as a small complaint. Buttons that looked fine in English looked wrong in German. So I rebuilt the whole thing around the text instead of the other way round. Every text button now sizes itself to its label. Same artwork, same corners, no clipped words, in every language. Twenty","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T06:38:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697001","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1842846814454160","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"All 11 Translations has been reviewed by humans!","summary":"Since the narrative is the heart of this game, as it started as my comic, my OC, I really wanted to give all languages justice (11 of them, not an easy task!) Luckily, I was able to find people helping me to check the AI translation, which surprisingly wasn't bad but definitely not on par with real native reviewers, especially since Asana is heavily a comedy!This is why I was proud to add a CREDIT page to both the demo and final game with the names of all the authors who helped me fix the locali","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T22:38:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454160","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1842846814445334","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"ASANA!!!! the doll","summary":"After Neko finally ASANA is ready and kicking in the human world!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T04:40:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1842846814439158","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"We made the selection to the DEVGAMM!","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T03:22:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439158","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1841579228674072","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"I found someone helping with the Portuguese/Brazilian translation","summary":"Since the data show a lot of \"visits\" from Brazil (more than Italy, France, or Germany), I decided to ask for help with the translation and found it!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T21:13:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228674072","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1841579228664403","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"NEKO, the stuffed doll!","summary":"I asked my friend in Rome to make the 4 main characters as stuffed dolls. Neko, the first one is ready. I will keep you posted when the other are readyOur lovely know-it-all AI NEKO!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T05:14:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228664403","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1840944183775579","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"Paradox - Casting","summary":"Here is a fun video of my selection for Paradox","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T03:17:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775579","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4603100-1840310314353370","game_id":"steam-4603100","kind":"announcement","title":"Asana \"the making\"","summary":"Hi, I'm Jacopo — a solo creator from Italy, and ASANA is my first game. Since this is the very first post on this hub, you get the origin story.Before ASANA, I made my first comic, Tokyo Roommates: two volumes, about 120 pages per volume. It went better than I dared to hope. But one note came back again and again: \"too sexualized.\" There were no explicit scenes, and the nudity stayed artistic, but the label stuck anyway. Usually with a bonus line: \"AI-assist only works because it is always sexua","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T07:26:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353370","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4603100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4603100":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4603100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z"},"4603740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:33Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4603100","app_id":4603100,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:42Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"58e1e4d8e438c1b719f9175ca4aca89d9b31c1f99c2fb1c3fbaa8236d0e50ce6","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"영어 음성을 지원하는 SF 다크 코미디 비주얼 노벨. 능력치를 정하고, 선택에 따라 갈라지는 이야기를 따라가며, 고양이 모습의 함선 AI N.E.K.O.와 말싸움을 벌이세요. 특정 장면에서 실시간 AI에게 직접 말을 걸고 대화 도전에 나설 수 있습니다. N.E.K.O.는 여전히 감흥이 없습니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Testudo"}],"developers":[{"name":"Testudo"}],"franchises":[{"name":"Asana"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796803200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"ASANA Visual Novel","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791428633","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4603100/866368907/3a4f96fa0ca460988d8e992b5e1f8902d34e1b0f/1775620491/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filenam